<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>2026 樂齡「同理」編程設計大賽 – 心繫照護</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Inter', "PingFang HK", sans-serif; background-color: #f8fafc; }
        .hero-gradient { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%); }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="text-slate-800">

    <header class="hero-gradient text-white py-20 px-6 text-center">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">2026 樂齡「同理」編程設計大賽</h1>
            <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-6">「從照護者視角出發 — 開發守護長者健康的貼心手機 App」</p>
            <p class="text-slate-300 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">結合 Smart Learning Suite | Health Kit & Sport Kit，以同理心為核心，為長者與照護者打造更好的生活品質。</p>
            <a href="https://wa.me/85296107184" class="bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-full transition duration-300 shadow-lg">
                立即報名 (截止日期：2026-04-17)
            </a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="py-16 px-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-slate-900 border-b-2 border-emerald-500 pb-2 inline-block">參賽對象與組別</h2>
                <ul class="space-y-3 mt-4">
                    <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-emerald-500 mr-2">●</span> <strong>小學組：</strong> 2-5人一隊，僅限使用 MIT App Inventor [cite: 2, 5]</li>
                    <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-emerald-500 mr-2">●</span> <strong>中學組：</strong> 2-5人一隊，可選 MIT App Inventor 或 iOS (Swift) [cite: 2, 5]</li>
                    <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-emerald-500 mr-2">●</span> <strong>必備硬體：</strong> 作品必須連結 Health Kit 或 Sport Kit 硬體 [cite: 2, 3]</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-slate-900 border-b-2 border-emerald-500 pb-2 inline-block">重要日期</h2>
                <div class="space-y-4 mt-4">
                    <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2"><span>報名截止</span><span class="font-semibold">2026-04-17</span></div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2"><span>作品遞交截止</span><span class="font-semibold">2026-05-22</span></div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2"><span>入圍公佈</span><span class="font-semibold">2026-06-12</span></div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between font-bold text-emerald-600"><span>決賽及頒獎禮</span><span>2026-07-03</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 bg-slate-100 px-6">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 text-slate-900">10 大專業 App 提案 (MIT App Inventor 可行方案)</h2>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border-t-4 border-emerald-500">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2 text-slate-900">1. 跌倒偵測與智慧預警</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">使用 <strong>Sport Kit</strong>。當偵測到跌倒，App 自動向照護者發送包含 GPS 位置的簡訊。</p>
                    <div class="text-xs bg-slate-100 p-2 rounded text-slate-500 font-mono">技術點: AccelerometerSensor, Texting, GPS</div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border-t-4 border-emerald-500">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2 text-slate-900">2. 服藥伴侶與物理提醒</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">使用 <strong>Health Kit</strong>。硬體準時閃爍提醒；若長者未服用，照護者會收到「漏藥通知」。</p>
                    <div class="text-xs bg-slate-100 p-2 rounded text-slate-500 font-mono">技術點: Clock Component, BluetoothClient</div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border-t-4 border-emerald-500">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2 text-slate-900">3. 每日心情與健康追蹤</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">使用 <strong>Health Kit</strong>。紀錄心率與長者心情，生成每週報告，幫助照護者預測健康變化。</p>
                    <div class="text-xs bg-slate-100 p-2 rounded text-slate-500 font-mono">技術點: Heart Rate Sensor, TinyDB</div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border-t-4 border-emerald-500">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2 text-slate-900">4. 關節健康運動教練</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">使用 <strong>Sport Kit</strong>。追蹤肢體擺動次數，提供語音鼓勵。照護者可遠端查閱進度。</p>
                    <div class="text-xs bg-slate-100 p-2 rounded text-slate-500 font-mono">技術點: OrientationSensor, TextToSpeech</div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border-t-4 border-emerald-500">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2 text-slate-900">5. 水分與營養管家</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">使用 <strong>Health Kit</strong>。監測飲水量，當攝取不足時提醒照護者提供適合的軟食建議。</p>
                    <div class="text-xs bg-slate-100 p-2 rounded text-slate-500 font-mono">技術點: Web Component (Weather API)</div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border-t-4 border-emerald-500">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2 text-slate-900">6. 照護者壓力觀測站</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">使用 <strong>Health Kit</strong>。監測照護者心率，檢測壓力水平並引導深呼吸練習。</p>
                    <div class="text-xs bg-slate-100 p-2 rounded text-slate-500 font-mono">技術點: Biofeedback, Pulse Sensor</div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border-t-4 border-emerald-500">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2 text-slate-900">7. 聲控緊急呼救</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">使用 <strong>Sport Kit</strong>。長者喊出「救命」或按鈕，自動撥打電話並發送錄音。 [cite: 7]</p>
                    <div class="text-xs bg-slate-100 p-2 rounded text-slate-500 font-mono">技術點: SpeechRecognizer, PhoneCall</div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border-t-4 border-emerald-500">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2 text-slate-900">8. 睡眠質量監測儀</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">使用 <strong>Sport Kit</strong>。置於床邊監測翻身頻率，為照護者提供睡眠質量數據改善建議。</p>
                    <div class="text-xs bg-slate-100 p-2 rounded text-slate-500 font-mono">技術點: Micro-accelerometer data</div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border-t-4 border-emerald-500">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2 text-slate-900">9. 簡易視訊連心</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">使用 <strong>Health Kit</strong>。一鍵式超大視訊按鈕，支援照護者遠端啟動安全性檢查。</p>
                    <div class="text-xs bg-slate-100 p-2 rounded text-slate-500 font-mono">技術點: ActivityStarter (WhatsApp/FaceTime)</div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border-t-4 border-emerald-500">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2 text-slate-900">10. 平衡與穩定度測試</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">使用 <strong>Sport Kit</strong>。監測行走重心，若不穩則發出警示以預防跌倒風險。</p>
                    <div class="text-xs bg-slate-100 p-2 rounded text-slate-500 font-mono">技術點: X/Y Axis Calculation</div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-8">評分準則</h2>
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
            <table class="w-full text-left bg-white">
                <thead class="bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200">
                    <tr>
                        <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">準則項目</th>
                        <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">佔比</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
                    <tr><td class="px-6 py-4">UI/UX 設計 (吸引力、導覽、適合受眾) [cite: 6]</td><td class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">30%</td></tr>
                    <tr><td class="px-6 py-4">程式設計 (計算準確、代碼效率) [cite: 10]</td><td class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">20%</td></tr>
                    <tr><td class="px-6 py-4">創新與創造力 (獨特性、硬體運用) [cite: 10]</td><td class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">15%</td></tr>
                    <tr><td class="px-6 py-4">社會影響 (提升生活品質、滿足需求) [cite: 10]</td><td class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">15%</td></tr>
                    <tr><td class="px-6 py-4">演講表現 (清晰度、演講風格、時間管理) [cite: 10]</td><td class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">20%</td></tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 bg-orange-50 px-6">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto border-2 border-dashed border-orange-200 rounded-3xl p-10">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-orange-800 mb-6">遞交作品要求</h2>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-orange-900 mb-2">MIT App Inventor 組</h3>
                    <ul class="text-orange-800 space-y-2 list-disc pl-5">
                        <li>作品簡報 (不多於15頁PDF) [cite: 3]</li>
                        <li>Android 檔案 (.aia 及 .apk) [cite: 3]</li>
                        <li>5分鐘介紹影片連結 (選填) [cite: 3]</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-orange-900 mb-2">iOS 組 (中學組適用)</h3>
                    <ul class="text-orange-800 space-y-2 list-disc pl-5">
                        <li>作品簡報 (不多於15頁PDF) [cite: 3]</li>
                        <li>Xcode 專案壓縮檔 (.zip) [cite: 3]</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-orange-700 italic font-semibold italic">截止日期：2026年5月22日 [cite: 5]</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-400 py-12 px-6 text-center">
        <p class="mb-2">主辦單位：iReD Solutions Limited [cite: 1]</p>
        <p class="mb-6 italic">iReD Solutions Limited 保留所有有關比賽事項的最終決定權。 [cite: 14]</p>
        <div class="flex justify-center space-x-6">
            <a href="https://wa.me/85296107184" class="hover:text-white">WhatsApp: 9610 7184 [cite: 14]</a>
            <a href="mailto:support@ired.com.hk" class="hover:text-white">Email: support@ired.com.hk [cite: 6]</a>
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
